1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,740
One computer, several GitHub accounts, and the right
identity for

2
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:11,140
every project. This setup organizes your name, email,
SSH key,

3
00:00:11,540 --> 00:00:15,880
GitHub session, and configuration by folder. We will
install it

4
00:00:15,880 --> 00:00:19,580
