5
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:24,780
The entire demonstration runs inside a disposable Linux
container, so

6
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:28,280
changes apply to its test user. We will walk through

7
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:30,520
