16
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:13,340
We choose a password manager and enter the name that

17
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:17,340
will appear on commits. The first identity is personal:
we

18
00:01:17,340 --> 00:01:21,000
provide its GitHub username and email address. When the
