33
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:25,600
The next step is SSH keys. In a real installation,

34
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:29,160
you can create a key in 1Password or paste the

35
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:32,940
public part of an existing key. Here we paste
