36
00:02:32,940 --> 00:02:36,560
public keys. Adding these keys to the configuration does
not

37
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:40,780
sign you in. Authentication and signing require the
matching private

38
00:02:40,780 --> 00:02:44,340
keys in your password manager and an active SSH agent.

39
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:47,960
This recording does not connect to real accounts or
password

40
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:48,400
