41
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:58,580
Before applying anything, we review the summary:
folders, emails, hosts,

42
00:02:59,140 --> 00:03:03,980
GitHub sessions, and services. After confirmation, the
wizard saves the

43
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:08,040
answers and generates each identity's files. It then
