44
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:12,220
changes chezmoi will apply to the home directory.
Existing files

45
00:03:12,220 --> 00:03:15,580
that will be replaced receive backup copies. We confirm
the

46
00:03:15,580 --> 00:03:19,740
installation inside the container. Your own preferences
