57
00:04:06,520 --> 00:04:11,180
To finish a real installation, follow the next-steps
checklist. Add

58
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:14,920
each public key to GitHub for authentication and
signing, sign

59
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:19,160
in to gh using the specified configuration directory,
and store

60
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:24,020
your tokens in your password manager. Then run secrets-
sync to

61
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:27,860
populate the encrypted local cache. This demo does not
test

62
00:04:27,860 --> 00:04:31,700
pushes, signatures, or secret retrieval. You can run the
wizard

63
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:34,960
